      "message": "I\u0027m not sure this is the right time to delete the intents: the index update may not have been flushed to disk yet, as Lucene has a background thread that flushes pending updates.\n\nI see two ways forward:\n\n1. Force the Lucene indexing flushing here, synchronously, and then remove the pending index updates\n2. Hook into the next indexing flushing and provide a lambda to remove these indexing intents once the flush is complete\n\nThe 1. may introduce a performance regression, as we may end up flushing to Lucene more often than we do today.",
